  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "encabezado",
  "texto": "## Pitfalls to avoid",
  "sha256_unidad": "cda53276d89250f9b773e9791b663650887da1f02373e5af3e3253e52d2789dc",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": "INV-011705"
 },
 {
  "id": "INV-011756",
  "archivo": "skills/visual-prompt-forge/adapters/gpt-image.md",
  "encabezado": "Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Pitfalls to avoid",
  "linea_inicial": "86",
  "linea_final": "86",
  "pagina_inicial": "2",
  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "ítem de lista",
  "texto": "- **Don't write Midjourney-style comma stacks**. GPT Image parses them as a list of disconnected concepts",
  "sha256_unidad": "66ceab8933de3e0e241ebfac5ac1a4c2c6e58866d6c189f903c3a080e1e372ee",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "INV-011757",
  "archivo": "skills/visual-prompt-forge/adapters/gpt-image.md",
  "encabezado": "Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Pitfalls to avoid",
  "linea_inicial": "87",
  "linea_final": "87",
  "pagina_inicial": "2",
  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "ítem de lista",
  "texto": "- **Don't omit spatial language when the shot has specific composition**, you're paying for the model's strength; use it",
  "sha256_unidad": "369d8028525958575771bcda8d066e6aba05687eab63dc398e0267bc481af0e6",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "INV-011758",
  "archivo": "skills/visual-prompt-forge/adapters/gpt-image.md",
  "encabezado": "Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Pitfalls to avoid",
  "linea_inicial": "88",
  "linea_final": "88",
  "pagina_inicial": "2",
  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "ítem de lista",
  "texto": "- **Don't pile too many objects**, five or fewer distinct elements per scene; more degrades fidelity",
  "sha256_unidad": "b350262fcbe635ecb37248bfbc86c85ba081e16b3dd945d7d46d2c809c062995",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "INV-011759",
  "archivo": "skills/visual-prompt-forge/adapters/gpt-image.md",
  "encabezado": "Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Pitfalls to avoid",
  "linea_inicial": "89",
  "linea_final": "89",
  "pagina_inicial": "2",
  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "ítem de lista",
  "texto": "- **Don't include `--ar` flags or weight syntax**. GPT Image ignores them",
  "sha256_unidad": "455c28a9069f18ab81b09244979f280486baa473ad1840f56a23e999820ecc07",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "INV-011760",
  "archivo": "skills/visual-prompt-forge/adapters/gpt-image.md",
  "encabezado": "Adapter: GPT Image (1.5 / 2) › Pitfalls to avoid",
  "linea_inicial": "90",
  "linea_final": "90",
  "pagina_inicial": "2",
  "pagina_final": "2",
  "tipo_unidad": "ítem de lista",
  "texto": "- **Don't forget that GPT Image's \"AI look\" is real**, the closing \"natural skin texture, no AI rendering artifacts\" line meaningfully helps but isn't a complete fix. For pure photoreal, Flux is still stronger",
  "sha256_unidad": "af8e1c576056fb9eb13db944dd40f2c0f920dcb5d3f632dddab06912b74e7a81",
  "texto_duplicado_en_otra_unidad": ""
 },
